    <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered id="f-172" contextRef="c-82">During 2025, Sea Robin Pipeline Company, LLC ("Sea Robin") was engaged in the gathering and transportation of natural gas from various points in the Gulf of America, offshore Louisiana, for processing and delivery to various transmission pipelines and a storage company at locations near its onshore terminus points near Erath, Louisiana in Vermilion Parish, near Patterson, Louisiana in St. Mary Parish, and near Kaplan, Louisiana, in Vermilion Parish. Sea Robin is an open access jurisdictional pipeline.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered>
