t;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="113" style="width: 85.05pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;1,177&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="114" style="width: 85.5pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;Customer B&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="19" style="width: 14.15pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="107" style="width: 80.35pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;495&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="19" style="width: 14.15pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="113" style="width: 85.05pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;703&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="114" style="width: 85.5pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;Customer C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="19" style="width: 14.15pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="107" style="width: 80.35pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;171&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="19" style="width: 14.15pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="113" style="width: 85.05pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;102&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="114" style="width: 85.5pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;Customer D&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="19" style="width: 14.15pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="107" style="width: 80.35pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;210&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="19" style="width: 14.15pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="113" style="width: 85.05pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;345&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="114" style="width: 85.5pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;Customer E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="19" style="width: 14.15pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="107" style="width: 80.35pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;53&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="19" style="width: 14.15pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="113" style="width: 85.05pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;77&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;/table&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 style="margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.35in; line-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: none"&gt;&lt;span&gt;14.&lt;span style="font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Fair Value Measurement &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.2in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Under Accounting Standards Codification (&amp;quot;ASC&amp;quot;) Topic 820, Fair Value Measurement, the fair value measurements are characterized in one of three levels based upon the input used to arrive at the measurement. The three levels of the fair value hierarchy are as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0.7in"&gt;&lt;li style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 105%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;Level 1 inputs are quoted prices (unadjusted) in active markets for identical assets or liabilities that the reporting entity can access at the measurement date;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 105%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;Level 2 inputs are inputs other than quoted prices included within Level 1 that are observable for the asset or liability, either directly or indirectly; and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 105%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;Level 3 inputs are unobservable inputs for the asset or liability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.2in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Assets and liabilities are classified in their entirety based on the lowest level of input that is significant to the fair value measurement. Sea Robin's assessment of the significance of a particular input to the fair value measurement requires judgment and may affect the valuation of these assets and liabilities and their placement within the fair value hierarchy. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.2in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Sea Robin has investments in its ARO trust that are measured at fair value on a recurring basis. The carrying amounts of accounts receivable and accounts payable approximate their fair value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 style="margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.35in; line-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: none"&gt;&lt;span&gt;15.&lt;span style="font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.2in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;The FERC's Revised Policy Statement on Treatment of Income Taxes Docket No. PL17-1, states that it no longer permits master limited partnerships including a company that does not pay taxes itself and is owned by a master limited partnership, to recover an income tax allowance in their cost of service.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 style="margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.35in; line-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: none"&gt;&lt;span&gt;16.&lt;span style="font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Taxes, Other Than on Income&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.2in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Taxes, other than on income primarily consist of ad valorem tax paid on the assessed value of Sea Robin's natural gas transmission lines based on fixed rates established by the applicable state or local taxing authorities. Ad valorem taxes are generally based on assessed property value at the beginning of each year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 style="margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.35in; line-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: none"&gt;&lt;span&gt;17.&lt;span style="font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Commitments and Contingencies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.2in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Sea Robin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt; is subject to proceedings, lawsuits and other claims related to environmental and other matters.Accounting for contingencies requires significant judgment by management regarding the estimated probabilities and ranges of exposure to potential liability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1 style="margin: 24pt 0 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;NOTE C - RELATED PARTY TRANSACTIONS:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.2in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;The following table provides a summary of affiliate transactions for the periods presented:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="569" style="width: 427.1pt; margin-left: 0.25in" class="e-rte-paste-table"&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 15.7pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="324" valign="bottom" style="width: 243pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.7pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="245" colspan="5" valign="bottom" style="width: 184.1pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.7pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="center" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;Years Ended December 31,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 15.75pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="324" valign="bottom" style="width: 243pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.75pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="106" valign="bottom" style="width: 1.1in; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.75pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="center" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="34" colspan="2" valign="bottom" style="width: 25.65pt; border-top: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.75pt"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="106" colspan="2" valign="bottom" style="width: 79.25pt; border-top: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-right: none; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.75pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="center" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 15.75pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="324" valign="bottom" style="width: 243pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.75pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="245" colspan="5" valign="bottom" style="width: 184.1pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.75pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="center" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;(In thousands)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 15.75pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="324" valign="bottom" style="width: 243pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.75pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Operating revenues&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;(1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="108" colspan="2" valign="bottom" style="width: 81pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.75pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="34" colspan="2" valign="bottom" style="width: 25.65pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.75pt"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="103" valign="bottom" style="width: 77.45pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.75pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 15.75pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="324" valign="bottom" style="width: 243pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.75pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Operating expenses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;(2)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="108" colspan="2" valign="bottom" style="width: 81pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.75pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;3,317&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="34" colspan="2" valign="bottom" style="width: 25.65pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.75pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="103" valign="bottom" style="width: 77.45pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.75pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;3,166&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 18.4pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="324" valign="bottom" style="width: 243pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 18.4pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Interest income,   net&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;(3)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="108" colspan="2" valign="bottom" style="width: 81pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 18.4pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;55&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="34" colspan="2" valign="bottom" style="width: 25.65pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 18.4pt"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="103" valign="bottom" style="width: 77.45pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 18.4pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;467&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;    &lt;tr&gt;   &lt;td width="324" style="border: none"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="106" style="border: none"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="2" style="border: none"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="32" style="border: none"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="2" style="border: none"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="103" style="border: none"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;   &lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="line-height: 105%; margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.2in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-indent: 0"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;(1) Transportation revenues from Trunkline Field Services LLC, an indirect subsidiary of Energy Transfer. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="line-height: 105%; margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.2in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-indent: 0"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;(2) Corporate charges and shared services provided by Energy Transfer and its subsidiaries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="line-height: 105%; margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.2in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-indent: 0"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;(3) Interest income, net from cash management program.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.2in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Accounts receivable from associated companies and accounts payable to associated companies are from various operating and administrative charges and pass through billings. Sea Robin as a subsidiary of PEPL, participates in a cash management program with Energy Transfer. Cash funding activity is recorded in Notes receivable from associated companies, Account 145, or Notes payable to associated companies, Account 233, as appropriate. An interest rate of 5% per annum is applied to the net intercompany balance with PEPL.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1 style="margin: 24pt 0 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;NOTE D - UTILITY PLANT:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.2in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;The following table provides a summary of utility plant at the dates indicated:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="587" style="width: 652px; max-width: 1802.5px; height: 243px" class="e-rte-paste-table"&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 10.1626%"&gt;   &lt;td width="234" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.75pt; width: 41.8712%"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="104" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.75pt; width: 15.9509%"&gt;   &lt;p align="center" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: 